.TH std::ranges::views::drop_while,std::ranges::drop_while_view 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::ranges::views::drop_while,std::ranges::drop_while_view \- std::ranges::views::drop_while,std::ranges::drop_while_view

.SH Synopsis
